(5713298, 831441, 105457, '<td valign="top">GREAT definition, brilliant contrast with the glasses, I''ve tried to do that and my glasses were never so clear. Just have a itching feeling that the top of the glasses are not straight, but I''m sure it''s just a feeling.<br/> <br/>Great shot, well done!!</td>', 'GREAT definition, brilliant contrast with the glasses, I''ve tried to do that and my glasses were never so clear. Just have a itching feeling that the top of the glasses are not straight, but I''m sure it''s just a feeling. Great shot, well done!!', '2009-11-04 07:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713299, 831416, 105457, '<td valign="top">Love the colour cast on this one, superb nocturne, and a good tilt.</td>', 'Love the colour cast on this one, superb nocturne, and a good tilt.', '2009-11-04 07:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713300, 830227, 105457, '<td valign="top">Incredible how you made this without desaturation, it''s simply a stunning scenery and the tilt adds so much to the image. Great photo!</td>', 'Incredible how you made this without desaturation, it''s simply a stunning scenery and the tilt adds so much to the image. Great photo!', '2009-11-04 07:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713303, 831349, 105457, '<td valign="top">It''s got that painting feel, and it''s a great reflection. Congratulations!</td>', 'It''s got that painting feel, and it''s a great reflection. Congratulations!', '2009-11-04 07:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713304, 831464, 105457, '<td valign="top">Very HDR feeling to it, and yet perfectly accomplished. Love the way you cropped at the waist line, reminds me of Charlie Brown cartoons :)<br/> <br/>Great lighting (side light and fill flash), and the tilt and desaturation works beautifully.<br/> <br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'Very HDR feeling to it, and yet perfectly accomplished. Love the way you cropped at the waist line, reminds me of Charlie Brown cartoons :) Great lighting (side light and fill flash), and the tilt and desaturation works beautifully. Congratulations!', '2009-11-04 07:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713306, 831334, 105457, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF, and love the way it pulls your view to the left, even when I''m trying to go to the right :)</td>', 'Very good DOF, and love the way it pulls your view to the left, even when I''m trying to go to the right :)', '2009-11-04 07:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713307, 831170, 105457, '<td valign="top">Haha, it''s great you resisted the attempt to tilt the photo the other way (it''s the way people do), andd so it made me think twice.<br/> <br/>Good clarity all around.</td>', 'Haha, it''s great you resisted the attempt to tilt the photo the other way (it''s the way people do), andd so it made me think twice. Good clarity all around.', '2009-11-04 07:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713308, 831313, 105457, '<td valign="top">Superb colours, and the tilt adds a lot to the image. Just nitpicking, maybe some spot sensor cleaning (to eliminate some spots) would do this good.<br/> <br/>Great clarity!</td>', 'Superb colours, and the tilt adds a lot to the image. Just nitpicking, maybe some spot sensor cleaning (to eliminate some spots) would do this good. Great clarity!', '2009-11-04 07:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
