(5713328, 831295, 110041, '<td valign="top">Not sure that the tilt adds much to the photo. It doesn''t give me a sense of movement or ''design'' as per the challenge.<br/> <br/>However, the silhouette is good against the strong blue of the sky.</td>', 'Not sure that the tilt adds much to the photo. It doesn''t give me a sense of movement or ''design'' as per the challenge. However, the silhouette is good against the strong blue of the sky.', '2009-11-04 07:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713341, 831170, 110041, '<td valign="top">Good thinking and well executed. I think the inclination of the glass helps give a sense of movement - as if the liquid is ''sloshing'' in the glass.<br/> <br/>What prevents it from getting top marks is when I ask ''would I want a photo like this?'' department. The subject is just not interesting enough.</td>', 'Good thinking and well executed. I think the inclination of the glass helps give a sense of movement - as if the liquid is ''sloshing'' in the glass. What prevents it from getting top marks is when I ask ''would I want a photo like this?'' department. The subject is just not interesting enough.', '2009-11-04 07:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5713344, 831351, 110041, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but for the tilt!<br/> <br/>There''s also quite a lot of noise, particularly in the foreground which detracts.</td>', 'Nice photo, but for the tilt! There''s also quite a lot of noise, particularly in the foreground which detracts.', '2009-11-04 07:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
