(5714959, 831461, 45631, '<td valign="top">Yes, the image is tilted but the subject matter is not very interesting.  Work on choice of subject matter for a challenge.</td>', 'Yes, the image is tilted but the subject matter is not very interesting.  Work on choice of subject matter for a challenge.', '2009-11-05 02:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714962, 831029, 45631, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe this picture meets the challenge as I see it, as the image is not tilted.  Whilst you have used the rule of thirds the subject matter is not very interesting.  Work on meeting the requirements of the challenge and strengthening subject material.</td>', 'I don''t believe this picture meets the challenge as I see it, as the image is not tilted.  Whilst you have used the rule of thirds the subject matter is not very interesting.  Work on meeting the requirements of the challenge and strengthening subject material.', '2009-11-05 02:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714964, 830914, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a good image but it has received a low score from me as I don''t see this as a tilted image.</td>', 'This is a good image but it has received a low score from me as I don''t see this as a tilted image.', '2009-11-05 02:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714965, 830412, 45631, '<td valign="top">Low scoring image as the subject matter is...well...terrible.  I don''t mind images that make a statement but this just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Low scoring image as the subject matter is...well...terrible.  I don''t mind images that make a statement but this just doesn''t work for me.', '2009-11-05 02:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714966, 830453, 45631, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this image as tilted.  A bit off balance but it''s not tilted enough to meet this type of challenge.  Pity, as the location could have been used to great advantage for this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t see this image as tilted.  A bit off balance but it''s not tilted enough to meet this type of challenge.  Pity, as the location could have been used to great advantage for this challenge.', '2009-11-05 03:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714967, 831395, 45631, '<td valign="top">Interesting image but I don''t feel this meets the theme of the challenge - tilted.  This could be a picture in any challenge.  Processing is good, a shallower dof would have made it even better.</td>', 'Interesting image but I don''t feel this meets the theme of the challenge - tilted.  This could be a picture in any challenge.  Processing is good, a shallower dof would have made it even better.', '2009-11-05 03:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714969, 831309, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image but more of a tilt to the image would received a higher score from me. Using selective desaturation has created a point of interest that this shot would have lacked otherwise.</td>', 'This is a nice image but more of a tilt to the image would received a higher score from me. Using selective desaturation has created a point of interest that this shot would have lacked otherwise.', '2009-11-05 03:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714971, 831445, 45631, '<td valign="top">A fun image but it doesn''t meet the challenge for me.</td>', 'A fun image but it doesn''t meet the challenge for me.', '2009-11-05 03:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714974, 830393, 45631, '<td valign="top">For me this image doesn''t meet the Challenge as it is not tilted and it is also just a photo of a picture.</td>', 'For me this image doesn''t meet the Challenge as it is not tilted and it is also just a photo of a picture.', '2009-11-05 03:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714975, 831337, 45631, '<td valign="top">Please learn how to resize for challenges so that your image can be a stronger contender within the competition.  Details for resizing are in the tutorial section.  Now for the image.  Because this shot was taken in what appears to be the corner of a building it looses the tilted aspect that you should be trying to capture and the subject is not very interesting.</td>', 'Please learn how to resize for challenges so that your image can be a stronger contender within the competition.  Details for resizing are in the tutorial section.  Now for the image.  Because this shot was taken in what appears to be the corner of a building it looses the tilted aspect that you should be trying to capture and the subject is not very interesting.', '2009-11-05 03:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714977, 831391, 45631, '<td valign="top">I gather the ''tilted'' part of this image is to be the reflections in the bubble but this just doesn''t seem to work for me, sorry.</td>', 'I gather the ''tilted'' part of this image is to be the reflections in the bubble but this just doesn''t seem to work for me, sorry.', '2009-11-05 03:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714978, 831295, 45631, '<td valign="top">Yes, the image is tilted but the subject matter is not interesting.  Work on creating an image with interesting subject matter that will draw the viewer in.</td>', 'Yes, the image is tilted but the subject matter is not interesting.  Work on creating an image with interesting subject matter that will draw the viewer in.', '2009-11-05 03:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714981, 831302, 45631, '<td valign="top">Yes, the image is tilted but I don''t find the subject very interesting.</td>', 'Yes, the image is tilted but I don''t find the subject very interesting.', '2009-11-05 03:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714985, 831399, 45631, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me.  It looks like carpet squares placed on a timber floor and then heavily cropped.  For me it doesn''t meet the tilted aspect of the challenge.  Look for a more interesting subject, something that will make people want to look at the image, something that creates interest.</td>', 'Sorry, this just doesn''t work for me.  It looks like carpet squares placed on a timber floor and then heavily cropped.  For me it doesn''t meet the tilted aspect of the challenge.  Look for a more interesting subject, something that will make people want to look at the image, something that creates interest.', '2009-11-05 03:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714986, 831352, 69368, '<td valign="top">the red border is a tad to much in my eyes</td>', 'the red border is a tad to much in my eyes', '2009-11-05 03:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5714987, 830227, 45631, '<td valign="top">One of my top pics for this challenge.  Love the perspective and meets the challenge really well.  Hope to see it on the front page with a ribbon.  Well done. 10</td>', 'One of my top pics for this challenge.  Love the perspective and meets the challenge really well.  Hope to see it on the front page with a ribbon.  Well done. 10', '2009-11-05 03:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
