(5715853, 831220, 110909, '<td valign="top">scary image.  very imposing and you used the tilted angle to the maximum effect.  9</td>', 'scary image.  very imposing and you used the tilted angle to the maximum effect.  9', '2009-11-05 21:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715857, 831230, 110909, '<td valign="top">i can''t wait to see how you did this.  9</td>', 'i can''t wait to see how you did this.  9', '2009-11-05 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715861, 831195, 110909, '<td valign="top">love the post. 9</td>', 'love the post. 9', '2009-11-05 21:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715942, 830227, 104230, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, returned to comment.  Nicely done with the center lines leading you into the image and the choice of a restricted palette.  The angle adds a certain dynamism.  However I find the heavy border tens to overwhelm the more "delicate" B&amp;W portion of the picture and detracts rather than adds.</td>', 'Voted earlier, returned to comment.  Nicely done with the center lines leading you into the image and the choice of a restricted palette.  The angle adds a certain dynamism.  However I find the heavy border tens to overwhelm the more "delicate" B&W portion of the picture and detracts rather than adds.', '2009-11-05 23:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715944, 831195, 104230, '<td valign="top">Creative use of the tilt. I like how at this angle the leftmost paving stones align with the border and the arrow is almost horizontal.  Well seen, and I see that I did manage a slight smile!  Not voting.</td>', 'Creative use of the tilt. I like how at this angle the leftmost paving stones align with the border and the arrow is almost horizontal.  Well seen, and I see that I did manage a slight smile!  Not voting.', '2009-11-05 23:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715952, 831334, 54645, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry and bland, but soothing, color. Reminds of a Beatles'' album cover.</td>', 'I love the symmetry and bland, but soothing, color. Reminds of a Beatles'' album cover.', '2009-11-05 23:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715954, 831100, 54645, '<td valign="top">Drowning in the rat race. That''s America.</td>', 'Drowning in the rat race. That''s America.', '2009-11-05 23:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715955, 831434, 54645, '<td valign="top">Lovely curves and tones.</td>', 'Lovely curves and tones.', '2009-11-05 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715957, 831318, 54645, '<td valign="top">Where did the sky go!? ;) Doesn''t quite reach the point of the illusion that you may have been going for (my opinion of course), but I respect the effort.</td>', 'Where did the sky go!? ;) Doesn''t quite reach the point of the illusion that you may have been going for (my opinion of course), but I respect the effort.', '2009-11-05 23:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715958, 831333, 54645, '<td valign="top">Bit too far on the shadow/highlight/clarity/etc slider.</td>', 'Bit too far on the shadow/highlight/clarity/etc slider.', '2009-11-05 23:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715960, 830543, 54645, '<td valign="top">Peaceful scene. The subtle tilt is refreshing!</td>', 'Peaceful scene. The subtle tilt is refreshing!', '2009-11-05 23:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715961, 831449, 54645, '<td valign="top">spooky, tilt adds to the mood</td>', 'spooky, tilt adds to the mood', '2009-11-05 23:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715966, 831353, 54645, '<td valign="top">That''s a strong wind to tilt the whole plant! ;)</td>', 'That''s a strong wind to tilt the whole plant! ;)', '2009-11-06 00:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716041, 831434, 98162, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. A winner!</td>', 'Gorgeous. A winner!', '2009-11-06 04:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716042, 831101, 98162, '<td valign="top">Creative. I wonder how you got the level in the wineglas right. Or is it something firm.</td>', 'Creative. I wonder how you got the level in the wineglas right. Or is it something firm.', '2009-11-06 04:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716081, 831355, 59737, '<td valign="top">definitely tilted, good exposure nothing really blown out or underexposed, like the building reflection in the marble but overall not that interesting to me.</td>', 'definitely tilted, good exposure nothing really blown out or underexposed, like the building reflection in the marble but overall not that interesting to me.', '2009-11-06 06:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716082, 831391, 59737, '<td valign="top">Great bubble capture, tough to get a good image of a bubble, the image in the bubble is definitely distorted tilted not sure about the actual camera but challenge was for an unusual angle so this meets it.  Nice picture.</td>', 'Great bubble capture, tough to get a good image of a bubble, the image in the bubble is definitely distorted tilted not sure about the actual camera but challenge was for an unusual angle so this meets it.  Nice picture.', '2009-11-06 06:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716083, 831217, 59737, '<td valign="top">Don''t like spiders that much but this is a good shot of one, tilted, like the square crop and the processing.</td>', 'Don''t like spiders that much but this is a good shot of one, tilted, like the square crop and the processing.', '2009-11-06 06:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716090, 831006, 59737, '<td valign="top">Tilted yes, but not that interesting of a photo to me.  The picture seems equally divided between reeds and woods, favoring the reeds and getting closer to them for a tighter focus may have been better.</td>', 'Tilted yes, but not that interesting of a photo to me.  The picture seems equally divided between reeds and woods, favoring the reeds and getting closer to them for a tighter focus may have been better.', '2009-11-06 07:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716094, 830438, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, really sharp, like the squarish crop, the border works for me on this picture.</td>', 'Nice macro, really sharp, like the squarish crop, the border works for me on this picture.', '2009-11-06 07:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716098, 831420, 59737, '<td valign="top">she looks like she''s having fun, definitely a tilted image, the border doesn''t work for me on this one.</td>', 'she looks like she''s having fun, definitely a tilted image, the border doesn''t work for me on this one.', '2009-11-06 07:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716099, 831241, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus on the tulips, I like the the mix of colors on this.</td>', 'Nice soft focus on the tulips, I like the the mix of colors on this.', '2009-11-06 07:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716100, 831442, 59737, '<td valign="top">Liked this as a thumbnail, less so full sized.  I still like the mix of colors, patterns and soft look of the water.  The large negative space bottom right keeps drawing my attention, seems very bright.</td>', 'Liked this as a thumbnail, less so full sized.  I still like the mix of colors, patterns and soft look of the water.  The large negative space bottom right keeps drawing my attention, seems very bright.', '2009-11-06 07:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716101, 831413, 59737, '<td valign="top">Seems a little bit soft or too much of a crop, it''s got some tilt to it and has a nice bokeh.  the woodpecker seems to have missed the third and is a little too centered.</td>', 'Seems a little bit soft or too much of a crop, it''s got some tilt to it and has a nice bokeh.  the woodpecker seems to have missed the third and is a little too centered.', '2009-11-06 07:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716104, 831402, 59737, '<td valign="top">It''s tilted but not really anything to focus on here, the leaves don''t draw my attention to anywhere specific.</td>', 'It''s tilted but not really anything to focus on here, the leaves don''t draw my attention to anywhere specific.', '2009-11-06 07:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716105, 831140, 59737, '<td valign="top">The tilt doesn''t seem to add to the image, actually hurts the image for my eye, the large bush is also distracting, maybe if you had gotten in front of it.</td>', 'The tilt doesn''t seem to add to the image, actually hurts the image for my eye, the large bush is also distracting, maybe if you had gotten in front of it.', '2009-11-06 07:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716107, 831268, 59737, '<td valign="top">Ah Boat Quay, nice colors and long exposure, like the bum boat streaks, nice image.</td>', 'Ah Boat Quay, nice colors and long exposure, like the bum boat streaks, nice image.', '2009-11-06 07:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716108, 831397, 59737, '<td valign="top">Minimalist, like this, I like the play of the light and dark, the tilt adds a nicely to this even the wire works for me.</td>', 'Minimalist, like this, I like the play of the light and dark, the tilt adds a nicely to this even the wire works for me.', '2009-11-06 07:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716109, 831137, 59737, '<td valign="top">tilt doesn''t really add much, keep trying to turn my head to get everyone standing straight, this just doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'tilt doesn''t really add much, keep trying to turn my head to get everyone standing straight, this just doesn''t do much for me.', '2009-11-06 07:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716111, 831268, 76585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition!10</td>', 'Beautiful composition!10', '2009-11-06 07:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716112, 831239, 28564, '<td valign="top">Arles?</td>', 'Arles?', '2009-11-06 07:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716119, 831445, 76598, '<td valign="top">tilted?  I am glad they won....good for them</td>', 'tilted?  I am glad they won....good for them', '2009-11-06 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716121, 830453, 76598, '<td valign="top">This waterfall needs a circular polarizer.  It would take all the glare off the water on the rocks.</td>', 'This waterfall needs a circular polarizer.  It would take all the glare off the water on the rocks.', '2009-11-06 07:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716122, 830246, 76598, '<td valign="top">Guitar string?  very cool effect</td>', 'Guitar string?  very cool effect', '2009-11-06 07:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716125, 831337, 76598, '<td valign="top">Use all your pixels and your score will be higher, the image itself looks pretty good, but you can''t tell at this size.</td>', 'Use all your pixels and your score will be higher, the image itself looks pretty good, but you can''t tell at this size.', '2009-11-06 07:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716128, 831217, 76598, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but it strikes me as a little under exposed</td>', 'I really like this, but it strikes me as a little under exposed', '2009-11-06 07:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716138, 831287, 109790, '<td valign="top">looks really cool! wish you would''ve tilted it a bit more though...</td>', 'looks really cool! wish you would''ve tilted it a bit more though...', '2009-11-06 08:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716139, 830161, 59737, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the tilt and straighten technique, I like the post processing seems to be some subtle color left.  Looks like some lost highlights on teh hood and window.</td>', 'Not sure about the tilt and straighten technique, I like the post processing seems to be some subtle color left.  Looks like some lost highlights on teh hood and window.', '2009-11-06 08:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716141, 831282, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice rotation, think this would look better with a bottle.  Nice high contrast processing and B+W conversion.</td>', 'Nice rotation, think this would look better with a bottle.  Nice high contrast processing and B+W conversion.', '2009-11-06 08:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716142, 831280, 59737, '<td valign="top">Like how the angled portion of the top cap came out straight in this but overall not a lot to grab my attention here, background seems a little too busy for me.</td>', 'Like how the angled portion of the top cap came out straight in this but overall not a lot to grab my attention here, background seems a little too busy for me.', '2009-11-06 08:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716145, 831318, 59737, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of space, like how the open window draws your attention, seems to be just off of center, like the minimalist look on this one.</td>', 'Interesting use of space, like how the open window draws your attention, seems to be just off of center, like the minimalist look on this one.', '2009-11-06 08:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716146, 831334, 59737, '<td valign="top">Like how this one looks, the straight line of trees and the light colors work well with the darkly dressed model.  Lots of leading lines to follow, the tilt really does add to this.</td>', 'Like how this one looks, the straight line of trees and the light colors work well with the darkly dressed model.  Lots of leading lines to follow, the tilt really does add to this.', '2009-11-06 08:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716149, 831142, 59737, '<td valign="top">Seems more straight portrait orientation than really tilted but you could consider that tilted anyway.  This doesn''t have much to hold my attention.</td>', 'Seems more straight portrait orientation than really tilted but you could consider that tilted anyway.  This doesn''t have much to hold my attention.', '2009-11-06 08:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716151, 831361, 59737, '<td valign="top">Simple and minimalist, the contrails add to the image as the pole by itself would not have much interest, guess I would have liked to see the lines more parallel.</td>', 'Simple and minimalist, the contrails add to the image as the pole by itself would not have much interest, guess I would have liked to see the lines more parallel.', '2009-11-06 08:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716153, 831121, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good details and depth of field here, not quite sure on the placement of the swan in the frame but it does hit on a third.</td>', 'Good details and depth of field here, not quite sure on the placement of the swan in the frame but it does hit on a third.', '2009-11-06 08:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716155, 831101, 59737, '<td valign="top">This took a little bit of set-up, would have helped a little to clean up the drops of the wine glass.  Nice effort here.</td>', 'This took a little bit of set-up, would have helped a little to clean up the drops of the wine glass.  Nice effort here.', '2009-11-06 08:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716156, 831186, 59737, '<td valign="top">The tilt does not seem to help the image at all, not a lot going on here to catch attention.</td>', 'The tilt does not seem to help the image at all, not a lot going on here to catch attention.', '2009-11-06 08:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716158, 830938, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject like how the tilt makes the road look, nice leading lines.  I''m a sucker for streaking lights.</td>', 'Good choice of subject like how the tilt makes the road look, nice leading lines.  I''m a sucker for streaking lights.', '2009-11-06 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716161, 830821, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good for the time of year, interesting use of space, just seems to be something missing to give this more impact for me.</td>', 'Good for the time of year, interesting use of space, just seems to be something missing to give this more impact for me.', '2009-11-06 08:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716162, 831195, 59737, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be much added by the tilt here (although I admit it does make a normal scene more interesting) and the processing is a little too much for me.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be much added by the tilt here (although I admit it does make a normal scene more interesting) and the processing is a little too much for me.', '2009-11-06 08:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716165, 830246, 59737, '<td valign="top">Really shallow DOF, and nice abstract view.  There''s not a lot to keep my attention or contrast here , think it may have benefited from a high contrast B+W look but maybe not.</td>', 'Really shallow DOF, and nice abstract view.  There''s not a lot to keep my attention or contrast here , think it may have benefited from a high contrast B+W look but maybe not.', '2009-11-06 08:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716168, 831287, 59737, '<td valign="top">Great colors in the sky, and an interesting setting, looks like a fun place to be.  Think that the choice of centering the ring was good.</td>', 'Great colors in the sky, and an interesting setting, looks like a fun place to be.  Think that the choice of centering the ring was good.', '2009-11-06 08:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716170, 830335, 59737, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of benefit gained from the tilt for me, and too much of a yellowish color for my taste.</td>', 'Not a lot of benefit gained from the tilt for me, and too much of a yellowish color for my taste.', '2009-11-06 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716172, 831395, 59737, '<td valign="top">Seems more like sitting on a slanting branch then using tilt to make an interesting image.  Good depth of field but the background is too busy for me.</td>', 'Seems more like sitting on a slanting branch then using tilt to make an interesting image.  Good depth of field but the background is too busy for me.', '2009-11-06 09:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716176, 830914, 59737, '<td valign="top">Your really got down to it''s level here, or raised it up to yours, it''ll probably suffer from being too straight and not tilted but it''s a good angle.  Not much sense of motion in here.</td>', 'Your really got down to it''s level here, or raised it up to yours, it''ll probably suffer from being too straight and not tilted but it''s a good angle.  Not much sense of motion in here.', '2009-11-06 09:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716186, 831370, 59737, '<td valign="top">Keep wanting to see the ship slide out of the image (guess that gives it a sense of motion), not a very interesting subject to me</td>', 'Keep wanting to see the ship slide out of the image (guess that gives it a sense of motion), not a very interesting subject to me', '2009-11-06 09:05:47.000000', NULL, 1);
