(5717134, 831401, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good dynamic with the tilt and the model looking the opposite way, gives a good balance, not so keen on the location, sitting on a suitcase seems well suited to a road but no so much a brick wall.</td>', 'Good dynamic with the tilt and the model looking the opposite way, gives a good balance, not so keen on the location, sitting on a suitcase seems well suited to a road but no so much a brick wall.', '2009-11-07 00:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
