(5717145, 831029, 59737, '<td valign="top">You tilted the camera up, don''t think it added a lot of interest to the picture as it seems this is the only angle this can be shot from.  Good job of lining the sign up on a third and bold use of negative space.</td>', 'You tilted the camera up, don''t think it added a lot of interest to the picture as it seems this is the only angle this can be shot from.  Good job of lining the sign up on a third and bold use of negative space.', '2009-11-07 00:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
