(5717437, 830241, 59737, '<td valign="top">This has some nice colors to it, the tilt adds interest and I like the red and blue background.  The out of focus reflection is distracting and the mirror is not perfectly clean (maybe from previous attempts)</td>', 'This has some nice colors to it, the tilt adds interest and I like the red and blue background.  The out of focus reflection is distracting and the mirror is not perfectly clean (maybe from previous attempts)', '2009-11-07 09:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
