(5717443, 831434, 59737, '<td valign="top">Similar concept to the 4th place photo in the first tilted contest. This is a well done simple image wiht nice coloring.  The egg is nice and sharp.</td>', 'Similar concept to the 4th place photo in the first tilted contest. This is a well done simple image wiht nice coloring.  The egg is nice and sharp.', '2009-11-07 09:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
