(5717448, 830915, 59737, '<td valign="top">Seems to me that this would have been better if the level cut right across the center of the image and if the flowers were more of a match.  I think a high key background might have worked better for the image.</td>', 'Seems to me that this would have been better if the level cut right across the center of the image and if the flowers were more of a match.  I think a high key background might have worked better for the image.', '2009-11-07 09:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
