(5717455, 831107, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice photo idea, think a slightly more square crop would have worked better with maybe just the baby''s feet and the rings.  The toes on the bottom foot seem a little out of focus.</td>', 'Nice photo idea, think a slightly more square crop would have worked better with maybe just the baby''s feet and the rings.  The toes on the bottom foot seem a little out of focus.', '2009-11-07 09:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717462, 830759, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good use of tilt to enhance the photo, lots to look at here, nice deep depth of field and great details.</td>', 'Nice colors, good use of tilt to enhance the photo, lots to look at here, nice deep depth of field and great details.', '2009-11-07 09:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717482, 831334, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done! The person behind the tree was a stroke of genius. It would have been an interesting shot without, but is much more interesting with the person. -8-</td>', 'Very nicely done! The person behind the tree was a stroke of genius. It would have been an interesting shot without, but is much more interesting with the person. -8-', '2009-11-07 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717488, 831403, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. The lines are great, and the idea of tilting the bottle was genius! I think the over-all feel of the picture falls a little flat however. I really think this would have benefited a lot from the Disney treatment -- brighten and saturate. The whites look a little dingy, and and the colors are a tad washed out because of the lighting. 7 for setup and creativity. It it had "popped" a little more, it could have easily been an 8! very nice setup!</td>', 'I like this very much. The lines are great, and the idea of tilting the bottle was genius! I think the over-all feel of the picture falls a little flat however. I really think this would have benefited a lot from the Disney treatment -- brighten and saturate. The whites look a little dingy, and and the colors are a tad washed out because of the lighting. 7 for setup and creativity. It it had "popped" a little more, it could have easily been an 8! very nice setup!', '2009-11-07 10:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717663, 831195, 70270, '<td valign="top">Hilarious.  Take an ordinary photo, tilt your camera, and make it pop.  Spot on.  8</td>', 'Hilarious.  Take an ordinary photo, tilt your camera, and make it pop.  Spot on.  8', '2009-11-07 12:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
