(5721626, 830438, 108580, '<td valign="top">I am getting more appreciative of just how hard Macro work is now that I have started to experiment myself with the Sigma 180mm f/3.5. This is simply brilliant. I love the silvery detail on the hairs, the focus on the antennae  and your border. Cropping a bit tight and bokeh a bit OE (-1). I''m bumping to a 9. Please tell me how or what ring flash you used and the exposure thereof! Roz?</td>', 'I am getting more appreciative of just how hard Macro work is now that I have started to experiment myself with the Sigma 180mm f/3.5. This is simply brilliant. I love the silvery detail on the hairs, the focus on the antennae  and your border. Cropping a bit tight and bokeh a bit OE (-1). I''m bumping to a 9. Please tell me how or what ring flash you used and the exposure thereof! Roz?', '2009-11-10 12:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
