(5722336, 831396, 104230, '<td valign="top">Just bumped this to a 7. A nice take on the challenge. I like the leading line and the contrast between the white fence in morning/evening light and everything else.  The patch of brighter grass in the lower right provides some added interest and is well placed (...rule of thirds)</td>', 'Just bumped this to a 7. A nice take on the challenge. I like the leading line and the contrast between the white fence in morning/evening light and everything else.  The patch of brighter grass in the lower right provides some added interest and is well placed (...rule of thirds)', '2009-11-10 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 1);
