(5722371, 831337, 66384, '<td valign="top">looks like a really good image, but it would be much more effective if you would use the full size. Check out the tutorial for preparing you images for DPC challenges.</td>', 'looks like a really good image, but it would be much more effective if you would use the full size. Check out the tutorial for preparing you images for DPC challenges.', '2009-11-10 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
