(5722383, 831103, 101668, '<td valign="top">I do not know whether you are one of the people who posted about low scores and no comments so I opened randomly and thouth that what ever, I shall comment. This is rather nice and I rate it 5. There is no wow factor to it in my opinion and I am by no means a good photograhper. I have to rely on my eye and not as much on technique. The idea is wonderful but I think the title is misspelt. Not that it matters.</td>', 'I do not know whether you are one of the people who posted about low scores and no comments so I opened randomly and thouth that what ever, I shall comment. This is rather nice and I rate it 5. There is no wow factor to it in my opinion and I am by no means a good photograhper. I have to rely on my eye and not as much on technique. The idea is wonderful but I think the title is misspelt. Not that it matters.', '2009-11-10 23:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
