(5722910, 831432, 104198, '<td valign="top">Do not despair.  A lot of my entries are because " I Just don''t have anything better"!  I did not vote on this topic, but if I had This would have gotten a 6.  The color, lighting and focus are acceptable, and I kinda like the unvarnished raw reality of the shot! The mask has a eerie "twilight zone" sort of personality to it!  <br/>Keep on posting your entries!!  Not everybody here is a professional perfectionist with high quality expensive equipment!  Some ( perhaps a lot of us ) simply like to take pictures and this is a great venue to enter, enjoy and improve what we can do with what we got!</td>', 'Do not despair.  A lot of my entries are because " I Just don''t have anything better"!  I did not vote on this topic, but if I had This would have gotten a 6.  The color, lighting and focus are acceptable, and I kinda like the unvarnished raw reality of the shot! The mask has a eerie "twilight zone" sort of personality to it!  Keep on posting your entries!!  Not everybody here is a professional perfectionist with high quality expensive equipment!  Some ( perhaps a lot of us ) simply like to take pictures and this is a great venue to enter, enjoy and improve what we can do with what we got!', '2009-11-11 08:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5722913, 831198, 61073, '<td valign="top">This should have scored higher..but you have a great finish. Especially for your first challenge, wow! You should see some of my entries that have tanked...haha. I love the angle here and how I feel drawn into the image...Great job!!</td>', 'This should have scored higher..but you have a great finish. Especially for your first challenge, wow! You should see some of my entries that have tanked...haha. I love the angle here and how I feel drawn into the image...Great job!!', '2009-11-11 08:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
