(5723058, 831220, 42100, '<td valign="top">I''ve got enough sense to know that this is looking up...but my brain keeps trying to tell me that I''m looking down.  Like I''m on a space ship in outer-space looking down on a planet.  Disorienting in a very fun way!<br/> <br/>Congrats on winning the red ribbon!</td>', 'I''ve got enough sense to know that this is looking up...but my brain keeps trying to tell me that I''m looking down.  Like I''m on a space ship in outer-space looking down on a planet.  Disorienting in a very fun way! Congrats on winning the red ribbon!', '2009-11-11 09:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
