(5723226, 831163, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, and gave it a good score, but I agree with Jim -- I''d like to see it brightened up a bit. Soft focus doesn''t bother me a bit (probably my age), and I think it''s appropriate for this subject, which isn''t sharp in nature.</td>', 'I like this shot, and gave it a good score, but I agree with Jim -- I''d like to see it brightened up a bit. Soft focus doesn''t bother me a bit (probably my age), and I think it''s appropriate for this subject, which isn''t sharp in nature.', '2009-11-11 11:28:24.000000', NULL, 0),
