(5723395, 831293, 108580, '<td valign="top"><strike>No one</strike> Few people <u>look</u> anymore Oliver. It''s all McChuck cardboardburger or a greasy piece of Fried <strike>chicken</strike> cat and a shake in 30 seconds. Instant gratification world. I saw all the tilts and off course your camera was above and lens tilted down at subject. I noticed the similarity to Connor''s shot and at first thought of his Dad taking this shot, still, it''s a good stock photo for your other sites ;) Ich habe dir sieben gegeben.</td>', 'No one Few people look anymore Oliver. It''s all McChuck cardboardburger or a greasy piece of Fried chicken cat and a shake in 30 seconds. Instant gratification world. I saw all the tilts and off course your camera was above and lens tilted down at subject. I noticed the similarity to Connor''s shot and at first thought of his Dad taking this shot, still, it''s a good stock photo for your other sites ;) Ich habe dir sieben gegeben.', '2009-11-11 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
