(5723432, 831464, 61961, '<td valign="top">Agreed, excellent shot.  Great expression on the cute kid, too, and funny "rebel" clothes.  I''d love to know the full story of shooting ths one.<br/> <br/>PS: Wow, that''s a lot of gear on that policeman.</td>', 'Agreed, excellent shot.  Great expression on the cute kid, too, and funny "rebel" clothes.  I''d love to know the full story of shooting ths one. PS: Wow, that''s a lot of gear on that policeman.', '2009-11-11 14:03:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5723443, 831293, 61961, '<td valign="top">Yes, way underrated.  Maybe it came too soon on the heels of the beverage product shot challenge?  I admit I didn''t visually grab onto the drinking and driving connection, maybe the green color threw me off, since it''s not a color I associate with alcohol.  However, it''s a striking photo, unique in the challenge, and I thought the tilt was subtle but essential.  Cheers!</td>', 'Yes, way underrated.  Maybe it came too soon on the heels of the beverage product shot challenge?  I admit I didn''t visually grab onto the drinking and driving connection, maybe the green color threw me off, since it''s not a color I associate with alcohol.  However, it''s a striking photo, unique in the challenge, and I thought the tilt was subtle but essential.  Cheers!', '2009-11-11 14:06:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5723471, 830227, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice work, and congrats on the pretty blue thingie!  You did have spotters, right?  So you didn''t get creamed by someone coming around the curve, right?  Well obviously you didn''t get creamed because you managed to post this to the challenge.  Good thing!</td>', 'Nice work, and congrats on the pretty blue thingie!  You did have spotters, right?  So you didn''t get creamed by someone coming around the curve, right?  Well obviously you didn''t get creamed because you managed to post this to the challenge.  Good thing!', '2009-11-11 14:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
